ategories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"TUTQeLjq1UbkR5r8mOvMqw","review_id":"bywy0P_9Ov_WXKW2GGhkUw","date":"2017-12-17T04:14:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9525001645088196,"text_excerpt":"Went here for the first time tonight and loved it!! Three of us had the shrimp and fish ceviche, grilled octopus, quinoa salad, duck confit, and the fish and rice (first on entree list, a lot like a paella.) Everything other than the quinoa was truly outstanding. Two cocktails were also great. I don't even usually like duck, but it was a stand out, as was the octopus. Ceviche was perfectly balanced -- not too acidic, fish a beautiful texture. Service was good, atmosphere really nice but not stuffy and not too loud. We'll be back soon!"},{"business_id":"TUTQeLjq1UbkR5r8mOvMqw","review_id":"lNRh6d_gD7zt9LHwXC-p5g","date":"2018-12-06T00:32:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9462623596191406,"text_excerpt":"Wow. My husband and I were tooling around uptown and decided to turn to my yelp buddies to steer me to a new-to-me lunch spot. Once again you all have come through. We decided on Tito's and are so glad that we did. We found a parking spot directly in front of the restaurant and were impressed with the curb appeal. There are a several tables and chairs out front with colorful pillows that really set the tone for us. It all felt so inviting. We entered this bright, very pulled together, chic restaurant and were greeted warmly. We were seated in front by the large windows that overlook the interesting, beautiful homes and foot traffic on Magazine Street. Our drink order was taken and we were..."},{"business_id":"TUTQeLjq1UbkR5r8mOvMqw","review_id":"0t70ZdlMkufZ47uvERFLjA","date":"2017-08-30T16:19:57","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9453997015953064,"text_excerpt":"There is a difference between making plans and making reservations, and while I naively had my fingers crossed that Tito's had yet to be discovered...My fiance and I along with another couple walked into a packed house. No problem, they made us a reservation from an hour from the time we had arrived so we just went down the street and had a drink. Lesson learned, make reservations! We were seated promptly when we arrived, and our server was amazing! There when we needed him and knowledgeable about the menu. He dropped the amuse bouche of cancha and an aji limo (I think) that we could've drank it was so good. Most of us had never had Pisco, so he brought out a sampling for the table of whi..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"TUTQeLjq1UbkR5r8mOvMqw","photo_id":"UVDz3TAaD6t3gMlOOhv3YA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/UVDz3TAaD6t3gMlOOhv3YA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9179616570472717},{"business_id":"TUTQeLjq1UbkR5r8mOvMqw","photo_id":"mCnY4rQspNqcShaGQ-WYmg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/mCnY4rQspNqcShaGQ-WYmg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8584840297698975},{"business_id":"TUTQeLjq1UbkR5r8mOvMqw","photo_id":"iwbLJyg9qIqZagp-mDYRjQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/iwbLJyg9qIqZagp-mDYRjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8513275384902954},{"business_id":"TUTQeLjq1